#: data/scripts/profile_man.inc:94
msgctxt "ProfileMan_Text_CollectTrainerProfiles"
msgid ""
"Hello there, TRAINER!\n"
"You've got a wonderful smile, there.\p"
"I have a hobby--collecting the profiles\n"
"of POKéMON TRAINERS.$"
msgstr ""
"你好，训练家！\n"
"你的笑容真棒啊。\p"
"我有一个爱好——收集\n"
"宝可梦训练家的自我介绍。$"

#: data/scripts/profile_man.inc:100
msgctxt "ProfileMan_Text_MayISeeYourProfile"
msgid ""
"So, how about it?\n"
"May I see your profile?$"
msgstr ""
"怎么样？\n"
"能让我看看你的自我介绍吗？$"

#: data/scripts/profile_man.inc:104
msgctxt "ProfileMan_Text_EasyChatExplanation"
msgid ""
"You make your own profile by putting\n"
"together four words or phrases.\p"
"Here, I'll show you an example of a\n"
"profile using four pieces of text.\p"
"You can switch those four pieces with\n"
"other text pieces any which way you\l"
"like to make your own profile.\p"
"There are a lot of text pieces that\n"
"you can use.\p"
"They are arranged in groups like\n"
"POKéMON, lifestyles, and hobbies so\l"
"it is easier to look them up.\p"
"So, first, choose the group of text\n"
"pieces to display a list of choices.\p"
"Then, pick the choice you want.\p"
"Repeat for the remaining text choices,\n"
"and you'll have your very own profile.$"
msgstr ""
"自我介绍是由\n"
"4个词语或短句组成的。\p"
"来，我给你看一个\n"
"用4个词句组成的例子。\p"
"你可以随意把这4个词句\n"
"换成其他的词句，\l"
"组成你自己的自我介绍。\p"
"可以使用的词句有很多。\p"
"它们按照宝可梦、生活、\n"
"兴趣等类别分好了组，\l"
"查找起来很方便。\p"
"首先，选择一个词句的类别，\n"
"就会显示可以选择的列表。\p"
"然后，选择你想要的词句。\p"
"剩下的词句也照样选择，\n"
"就能完成你自己的自我介绍了。$"

#: data/scripts/profile_man.inc:123
msgctxt "ProfileMan_Text_LetsSeeItThen"
msgid ""
"Yes! Thank you!\n"
"So, let's see it, then.$"
msgstr ""
"好耶！谢谢你！\n"
"那就让我看看吧。$"

#: data/scripts/profile_man.inc:127
msgctxt "ProfileMan_Text_ImagineYouWouldHaveWonderfulProfile"
msgid ""
"Oh, no, really?\p"
"I imagine someone like you would have\n"
"a wonderful profile…$"
msgstr ""
"哎，真的不行吗？\p"
"我想像你这样的人，\n"
"一定会有很棒的自我介绍……$"

#: data/scripts/profile_man.inc:132
msgctxt "ProfileMan_Text_NotIntoItRightNow"
msgid ""
"Oh? You're not into it right now?\p"
"Well, anytime is good by me!$"
msgstr ""
"哦？你现在没兴趣吗？\p"
"没关系，我随时都可以！$"

#: data/scripts/profile_man.inc:136
msgctxt "ProfileMan_Text_YouHaveWonderfulSmile"
msgid ""
"Hello there, TRAINER!\n"
"You've got a wonderful smile.$"
msgstr ""
"你好，训练家！\n"
"你的笑容真棒啊。$"

#: data/scripts/profile_man.inc:140
msgctxt "ProfileMan_Text_MayISeeYourNewProfile"
msgid "May I see your new profile?$"
msgstr ""
"能让我看看\n"
"你新的自我介绍吗？$"

#: data/scripts/profile_man.inc:143
msgctxt "ProfileMan_Text_EvenBetterThanLastProfile"
msgid ""
"Yes! Thank you!\p"
"I hope it's even better than the profile\n"
"you showed me before.$"
msgstr ""
"好耶！谢谢你！\p"
"希望它比你之前给我看的\n"
"还要棒。$"

#: data/scripts/profile_man.inc:148
msgctxt "ProfileMan_Text_LikeProfileWayItIs"
msgid ""
"Oh, you like your profile the way it is.\p"
"I don't blame you--it's a wonderful\n"
"profile the way it is now.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，你喜欢现在的自我介绍啊。\p"
"也难怪——\n"
"你现在的自我介绍就很棒。$"

#: data/scripts/profile_man.inc:153
msgctxt "ProfileMan_Text_FantasticProfile"
msgid ""
"F-fantastic!\p"
"Your profile, it's wonderful!\n"
"It really says what you're about.\p"
"Why, anyone hearing this profile would\n"
"be captivated by you!\p"
"Thank you!$"
msgstr ""
"太、太棒了！\p"
"你的自我介绍真是太好了！\n"
"完全表现出了你的为人。\p"
"听到这个自我介绍的人，\n"
"一定都会被你吸引的！\p"
"谢谢你！$"

#: data/scripts/profile_man.inc:162
msgctxt "ProfileMan_Text_YouKnowSecretSaying"
msgid ""
"Oh?\n"
"You know the secret saying!\p"
"That means you're now a fellow member\n"
"of the MYSTERY EVENT CLUB!$"
msgstr ""
"哦？\n"
"你知道秘密暗号！\p"
"这就说明你现在也是\n"
"神秘活动俱乐部的成员了！$"
